  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pane imwe nguva akapinda musinagoge, uye imomo makanga mune murume akanga ane ruoko rwakanga rwakakokonyara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vamwe vavo vakanga vachitsvaka mhosva yavangapomera Jesu, saka vakamutarisisa kuti vaone kana aizomuporesa nomusi weSabata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu akati kumurume akanga ane ruoko rwakakokonyara, \"Simuka umire pamberi pavanhu vose.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo Jesu akavabvunza akati, \"Ndezvipiko zvinotenderwa nomusi weSabata: kuita zvakanaka kana kuita zvakaipa, kuponesa munhu kana kuuraya?\" Asi vakaramba vanyerere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atsamwa, akatarisa vanhu vose vakanga vakamukomberedza, uye ashungurudzwa nokuda kwokusindimara kwemwoyo yavo akati kumurume uya, \"Tambanudza ruoko rwako.\" Akarutambanudza, uye ruoko rwake rukaporeswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo vaFarisi vakabuda vakatanga kurangana navaHerodhi kuti vangauraya sei Jesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vazhinji Vanotevera Jesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu akabva kugungwa navadzidzi vake, uye vanhu vazhinji vaibva kuGarirea vakamutevera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vakati vanzwa zvose zvaakanga achiita, vanhu vazhinji vakauya kwaari vachibva kuJudhea, Jerusarema, Idhumea, uye namatunhu ari mhiri kweJorodhani, neakapoteredza Tire neSidhoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaudza vadzidzi vake kuti vamutsvagire igwa duku, kuitira kuti vanhu varege kumutsikirira nokuda kwokuwanda kwavo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainge aporesa vazhinji zvokuti vaya vakanga vane zvirwere vakanga vachisundana vachiuya mberi kuti vamubate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pose paaionekwa nemweya yakaipa, yaiwira pasi pamberi pake uye yaidanidzira ichiti, \"Ndimi Mwanakomana waMwari.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iye akairayira kwazvo kuti irege kutaura kuti akanga ari ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kusarudzwa kwaVapostori Gumi naVaviri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu akakwira pagomo akadana kwaari vaya vaaida, uye vakauya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasarudza vane gumi navaviri akavati vapostori, kuti vagare naye uye kuti agozovatuma kuti vandoparidza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uye kuti vave nesimba rokudzinga madhimoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ava ndivo gumi navaviri vaakasarudza:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "MRK 3:16"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simoni (uyo waakatumidza zita rokuti Petro),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobho mwanakomana waZebhedhi nomununʼuna wake Johani (avo vaakatumidza zita rokuti Bhoanerigesi, kureva kuti Vanakomana voKutinhira),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andirea,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Firipi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bhatoromeo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mateo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tomasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jakobho mwanakomana waArifeasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tadheo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simoni muZeroti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naJudhasi Iskarioti, uyo akamupandukira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu naBheerizebhubhi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo Jesu akapinda mune imwe imba, uye vazhinji vakaunganazve, zvokuti iye navadzidzi vake vakanga vasingagoni kunyange kudya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhuri yake yakati yazvinzwa, vakaenda kundomubata, nokuti vakati, \"Ava kupenga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uye vadzidzisi vomurayiro vaibva kuJerusarema vakati, \"Akabatwa nomweya waBheerizebhubhi! Ari kudzinga madhimoni nomuchinda wamadhimoni.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saka Jesu akavadana akataura kwavari nomufananidzo achiti, \"Ko, Satani angadzinga sei Satani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kana umambo huchizvipesanisa, umambo ihwohwo hahugoni kumira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kana imba ichizvipesanisa, imba iyoyo haigoni kumira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uye kana Satani achizvipikisa pachake uye achizvipesanisa, haangagoni kumira; kuguma kwake kwasvika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zviripo ndezvokuti, hakuna munhu angapinda mumba momunhu ane simba agotakura zvinhu zvake, kana asina kutanga asunga murume wacho ane simba. Ipapo angagona kupamba imba yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndinokuudzai chokwadi kuti zvivi zvose nokumhura kwavanhu kwose zvicharegererwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ani naani anomhura Mweya Mutsvene haazomboregererwi; ane mhosva yechivi chisingaperi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akataura izvozvo nokuti vakanga vachiti, \"Ano mweya wakaipa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mai vaJesu naVanunʼuna Vake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo mai vaJesu navanunʼuna vake vakauya. Vakatuma munhu kundomudana ivo vamire panze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vazhinji vakanga vagere vakamukomberedza, uye vakati kwaari, \"Mai venyu navanunʼuna venyu vari kukutsvakai panze.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye akati, \"Vanamai vangu navanunʼuna vangu ndivanaaniko?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo akatarisa kuna avo vakanga vagere vakaita denderedzwa vakamupoteredza akati, \"Ava ndivo mai vangu navanunʼuna vangu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani naani anoita kuda kwaMwari ndiye mununʼuna wangu nehanzvadzi, uye namai vangu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
